Package: readabilityes
Title: Readability Index Calculation for Spanish and Catalan Texts
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("First", "Last", , "first.last@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Provides functions to calculate readability metrics for Spanish
    and Catalan texts, including word, sentence, and syllable counting,
    syllabification, and text cleaning and tokenization adapted to the
    orthographic rules of each language. Readability indexes (e.g.,
    Szigriszt-Pazos and Gutierrez de Polini, currently available for
    Spanish) are calculated through a unified interface.
